          <div class="modal-header">
            <button class="close" type="button" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
              <h5>Got an idea for how we can make Kickserv better? Tell us about it here.</h5>
              <small>Please, no bug reports or help requests.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="modal-body">
            <div id="productboard_feedback_loader">
              <div class="spinner">
